From f868a285d198ad318eabdd58b2924c68444a6585 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: auroraswapro <auroraswapro@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:46:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Projects: Aurora team tracker features and Aurora Promotions
 branding

Projects page (same Firestore data and security rules as before):
- Overview tab: headline numbers, team progress per person, deadlines,
  project progress, tasks by status, latest updates, star of the week
- My tasks: cards with an autosaving progress slider, status menu,
  one-tap Done (with confetti) and Add note
- Board with five columns (new Blocked status), project cards,
  Team tab with workload and a per-person drawer
- Quick 0/25/50/75/100% progress buttons in the task drawer

Branding: AP logo in the top bar, sign-in card and browser tab; white
background with the logo's lavender as the accent colour.
Handbook and CLAUDE.md updated to match.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UEeLhMhc335hBJsbEcoA9r
